1
00:00:00,200 --> 00:00:01,711
Your smart TV is packed

2
00:00:01,711 --> 00:00:02,336
with ads?

3
00:00:02,336 --> 00:00:04,212
Claude Code can help transform

4
00:00:04,212 --> 00:00:05,254
its home screen!

5
00:00:05,604 --> 00:00:08,103
There's an open-source project called

6
00:00:08,103 --> 00:00:10,892
CleanYourTV that helps customize supported

7
00:00:10,892 --> 00:00:12,519
Android and Google TVs.

8
00:00:12,799 --> 00:00:14,666
It's on GitHub under an

9
00:00:14,666 --> 00:00:16,920
MIT license, with an official

10
00:00:16,920 --> 00:00:18,337
site, cleanyour.tv.

11
00:00:18,687 --> 00:00:19,815
On your own TV,

12
00:00:19,815 --> 00:00:22,520
enable debugging, authorize your computer,

13
00:00:22,520 --> 00:00:24,211
and let the tool inspect

14
00:00:24,211 --> 00:00:25,338
what's installed.

15
00:00:25,618 --> 00:00:27,093
Your computer must be on

16
00:00:27,093 --> 00:00:28,027
the same Wi-Fi,

17
00:00:28,027 --> 00:00:29,256
and the TV asks you

18
00:00:29,256 --> 00:00:30,043
to allow it.

19
00:00:30,393 --> 00:00:32,119
It backs up your settings,

20
00:00:32,119 --> 00:00:34,653
then helps identify unwanted preinstalled

21
00:00:34,653 --> 00:00:36,217
apps and recommendations.

22
00:00:36,497 --> 00:00:37,925
Nothing is uninstalled.

23
00:00:37,925 --> 00:00:39,406
Apps are only disabled,

24
00:00:39,406 --> 00:00:41,099
and you decide what stays.

25
00:00:41,449 --> 00:00:42,691
Then you can switch to

26
00:00:42,691 --> 00:00:43,711
a cleaner launcher,

27
00:00:43,711 --> 00:00:45,175
with your favorite apps and

28
00:00:45,175 --> 00:00:46,861
a more personalized home screen.

29
00:00:47,141 --> 00:00:48,700
It's a small launcher with

30
00:00:48,700 --> 00:00:50,064
a dock, an app library

31
00:00:50,064 --> 00:00:50,746
and themes.

32
00:00:51,096 --> 00:00:52,644
And because the changes can

33
00:00:52,644 --> 00:00:54,239
be reversed, you can restore

34
00:00:54,239 --> 00:00:55,975
the previous setup if something

35
00:00:55,975 --> 00:00:56,725
doesn't work.

36
00:00:57,005 --> 00:00:58,867
It works on Android and

37
00:00:58,867 --> 00:01:00,729
Google TVs, not Samsung,

38
00:01:00,729 --> 00:01:01,692
LG or Roku.

39
00:01:01,692 --> 00:01:03,874
Turn debugging off afterward.

40
00:01:04,224 --> 00:01:06,033
It won't remove every ad

41
00:01:06,033 --> 00:01:07,601
inside streaming apps,

42
00:01:07,601 --> 00:01:09,168
but it can make your

43
00:01:09,168 --> 00:01:11,218
TV home screen much cleaner.

44
00:01:11,218 --> 00:01:13,388
Follow Agentoon.ai for more AI

45
00:01:13,388 --> 00:01:13,871
tools!
